      {
        "y": 24.7,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 310.2,
        "tag": "title",
        "text": "Weather and climate"
      },
      {
        "y": 70.7,
        "x0": 75.1,
        "x1": 226,
        "tag": "title",
        "text": "A Weather conversations"
      },
      {
        "y": 88.6,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 314.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Here are some less common but nonetheless useful"
      },
      {
        "y": 100.6,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 309.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "words about weather, so that you can have typical"
      },
      {
        "y": 112.6,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 286.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "weather conversations where you agree with"
      },
      {
        "y": 124.6,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 282.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "someone by using a near-synonym. In these"
      },
      {
        "y": 136.6,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 310.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "examples, B replies using more informal language."
      },
      {
        "y": 151.2,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 203.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "A: Bit cold today, isn’t it?"
      },
      {
        "y": 163.2,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 268.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "B: Yes, it’s chilly/freezing/nippy, isn’t it?"
      },
      {
        "y": 178,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 174.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "A: It’s hot, isn’t it?"
      },
      {
        "y": 190,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 265.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "B: Yes, it’s boiling/sweltering/roasting!"
      },
      {
        "y": 204.9,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 202.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "A: It’s a bit windy today!"
      },
      {
        "y": 216.9,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 248.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "B: Yes, really blowy/breezy, isn’t it?"
      },
      {
        "y": 231.7,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 250.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "A: What oppressive/sultry weather!"
      },
      {
        "y": 243.7,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 247.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "B: Yes, isn’t it stifling/heavy/close?"
      },
      {
        "y": 258.5,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 222.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "A: What a downpour/deluge!"
      },
      {
        "y": 270.5,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 280.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "B: Yes, it’s chucking it down / it’s pouring!"
      },
      {
        "y": 285.4,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 198,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "A: Isn’t it humid today?"
      },
      {
        "y": 297.4,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 301,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "B: Yes, horrible muggy/clammy/sticky weather!"
      },
      {
        "y": 318.5,
        "x0": 74.7,
        "x1": 228.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "B Climate and metaphors"
      },
      {
        "y": 336.5,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 371.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Climate metaphors are often used, particularly in written English."
      },
      {
        "y": 348.2,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 420.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "The word climate can refer to the general atmosphere or situation in society."
      },
      {
        "y": 360.2,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 339.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "His secrecy and dishonesty created a climate of distrust."
      },
      {
        "y": 372.2,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 378.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "The government reforms have contributed to a climate of change."
      },
      {
        "y": 384.2,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 487.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "The words cultural, current, economic, financial, moral, political, social and prevailing all"
      },
      {
        "y": 396.2,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 312.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "collocate strongly with climate in this social sense."
      },
      {
        "y": 408.2,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 365,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "She has a very sunny disposition – she’s hardly ever miserable."
      },
      {
        "y": 420.2,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 490.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Though they won the championship last year, the outlook for the team is less sunny this year."
      },
      {
        "y": 432.2,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 321.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Unfortunately, our plans met with a frosty reception."
      },
      {
        "y": 444.2,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 372.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "I’m snowed under with work – I’ll never get through it all in time."
      },
      {
        "y": 456.2,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 420.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "After the company accounts were examined, the manager left under a cloud."
      },
      {
        "y": 468.2,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 310.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Don’t let your love for him cloud your judgement."
      },
      {
        "y": 480.2,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 279.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "The soldiers were hit with a hail of bullets."
      },
      {
        "y": 492.2,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 349.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "The Prime Minister was greeted with a hail/storm of abuse."
      },
      {
        "y": 504.2,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 308.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "I’ve only a hazy memory of my first day at school."
      },
      {
        "y": 516.2,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 280.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "The truth is hidden in the mists of history."
      },
      {
        "y": 528.2,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 298.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "The article sparked a whirlwind of speculation."
      },
      {
        "y": 540.2,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 328.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "They had a whirlwind romance and got married just a"
      },
      {
        "y": 552.5,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 190.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "month after they met."
      },
      {
        "y": 564.2,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 279,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "The horses thundered down the racetrack."
      },
      {
        "y": 576.2,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 282.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Thunderous applause followed his speech."
      },
      {
        "y": 588.2,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 333.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "(Note that thundery is used to describe stormy weather"
      },
      {
        "y": 600.2,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 302.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "while thunderous describes a loud, deep noise.)"
      },
      {
        "y": 612.2,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 307.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "The winds of change/discontent/democracy are"
      },
      {
        "y": 624.5,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 214.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "blowing across the country."
      }
